provenance: HSPICE Y-2026.03-SP2-1, iccad4, 2026-11-07 (research/settle-remote.md, sections "P5-020 rerun" and "P5-020 sub-cases")
deck: `U1 in 0 out 0 um L=0.5 [LUMPS=n]`, `.model um U LEVEL=3 ELEV=2 PLEV=1 NL=1 LLEV=0 CR1=100p GR1=1e-4 L11=250n R11=0.5 [RRR=0.2]`, 50 ohm source, 100 ohm load, AC at 1 MHz to 1 GHz; each value the largest error of the ladder named, or the lump count that fits
# LUMPS=1, 2: uniform T-sections; LUMPS=3, 5: T-sections with half-length end lumps
lumps1_error 6.9e-9
lumps2_error 6.1e-9
